      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6ac555e685013beb68e8d56d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It's pretty annoying that you can't force equip things to players hands to make say things like custom inventory items or props for game modes more user-friendly. Games like fish would benefit from this with there fishing rod being auto equipped when spawned, and shooters don't need to hover a gun in front of you to pick up.",
